    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three highschool students got transported to another world, a comedy adventure begins. Shuichiro the weird who loves to wear mascot, Takeshi the popular the so called prince of tennis in school and Tosaka the cool headed girl. They've been sent to unknown forest without having any clues and one of them turned into a goblin, without present knowledge how will they overcome all of these?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445980/extras/f7f84ab564585555f40ce00f3c817a04.avif?t=1749234431\" width=541 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445980/extras/4b5e2aa2f9f788a4ec6337855ac4bba4.webp?t=1749234431\" width=422 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill monsters to earn gold, enjoy exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Armors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different types of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445980/extras/ad850aff82a071eec1e290d070ff5e6a.poster.avif?t=1749234431\" width=474 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445980/extras/ad850aff82a071eec1e290d070ff5e6a.webm?t=1749234431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445980/extras/ad850aff82a071eec1e290d070ff5e6a.mp4?t=1749234431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa